            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in ShawNotch 1.7.9</h2>
<ul>
<li>Quick add in the Calendar understands more of how you type: "Lunch @ 1pm", "tmrw", and "after tomorrow".</li>
<li>A weekday means the nearest one, so "Gym Tuesday" is this coming Tuesday (or today, if it's Tuesday), and "next Tuesday" is the one after that.</li>
<li>"Lunch at 1pm today" no longer keeps "at 1pm" in the event's name.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
